LIMIT 500;', '{"question": "查询SN号为 SN202400001 的过站履历", "scenario": "SN追溯查询", "full_text": "场景：SN追溯查询\n用户问题：查询SN号为 SN202400001 的过站履历\nSQL：\nSELECT \n  ss.sn,\n  st.node_name AS 工序,\n  st.pass_flag AS 是否通过,\n  st.create_time AS 过站时间,\n  st.operator AS 操作人\nFROM t_pd_sn_status ss\nLEFT JOIN t_pd_sn_travel st ON ss.sn = st.sn\nWHERE ss.sn = ''SN202400001''\nORDER BY st.create_time ASC\nLIMIT 500;"}');
