用户问题：本周各不良代码的数量统计
SQL：
SELECT 
  d.defect_name AS 不良名称,
  d.defect_code AS 不良代码,
  COUNT(sd.id) AS 不良数量
FROM t_pd_sn_defect sd
LEFT JOIN t_bd_defect d ON sd.defect_id = d.id
WHERE sd.create_time >= DATE_TRUNC(''week'', CURRENT_DATE)
GROUP BY d.defect_name, d.defect_code
ORDER BY 不良数量 DESC
LIMIT 500;', '{"question": "本周各不良代码的数量统计", "scenario": "不良统计分析", "full_text": "场景：不良统计分析\n用户问题：本周各不良代码的数量统计\nSQL：\nSELECT \n  d.defect_name AS 不良名称,\n  d.defect_code AS 不良代码,\n  COUNT(sd.id) AS 不良数量\nFROM t_pd_sn_defect sd\nLEFT JOIN t_bd_defect d ON sd.defect_id = d.id\nWHERE sd.create_time >= DATE_TRUNC(''week'', CURRENT_DATE)\nGROUP BY d.defect_name, d.defect_code\nORDER BY 不良数量 DESC\nLIMIT 500;"}');
