场景：查询今天各产线的工单完成情况
用户问题：今天各产线完成了多少工单
SQL：
SELECT 
  pl.pdline_name AS 产线名称,
  COUNT(wo.id) AS 工单总数,
  SUM(CASE WHEN wo.wo_status = ''40'' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS 完工数,
  SUM(CASE WHEN wo.wo_status IN (''20'',''30'') THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS 在制数
FROM t_pd_wo wo
LEFT JOIN t_bd_pdline pl ON wo.pdline_code = pl.pdline_code
WHERE DATE(wo.create_time) = CURRENT_DATE
GROUP BY pl.pdline_name
ORDER BY 完工数 DESC
LIMIT 500;', '{"question": "今天各产线完成了多少工单", "scenario": "查询今天各产线的工单完成情况", "full_text": "---\n场景：查询今天各产线的工单完成情况\n用户问题：今天各产线完成了多少工单\nSQL：\nSELECT \n  pl.pdline_name AS 产线名称,\n  COUNT(wo.id) AS 工单总数,\n  SUM(CASE WHEN wo.wo_status = ''40'' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS 完工数,\n  SUM(CASE WHEN wo.wo_status IN (''20'',''30'') THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS 在制数\nFROM t_pd_wo wo\nLEFT JOIN t_bd_pdline pl ON wo.pdline_code = pl.pdline_code\nWHERE DATE(wo.create_time) = CURRENT_DATE\nGROUP BY pl.pdline_name\nORDER BY 完工数 DESC\nLIMIT 500;"}');
