用户问题：查询料号 P001 在各仓库的库存数量
SQL：
SELECT 
  wh.warehouse_name AS 仓库名称,
  p.part_no AS 料号,
  p.part_name AS 料号名称,
  s.qty AS 库存数量,
  s.lot_no AS 批次
FROM t_wms_stock s
LEFT JOIN t_bd_part p ON s.part_no = p.part_no
LEFT JOIN t_wms_warehouse wh ON s.warehouse_id = wh.id
WHERE p.part_no = ''P001'' OR p.part_name ILIKE ''%P001%''
ORDER BY wh.warehouse_name
LIMIT 500;', '{"question": "查询料号 P001 在各仓库的库存数量", "scenario": "库存查询", "full_text": "场景：库存查询\n用户问题：查询料号 P001 在各仓库的库存数量\nSQL：\nSELECT \n  wh.warehouse_name AS 仓库名称,\n  p.part_no AS 料号,\n  p.part_name AS 料号名称,\n  s.qty AS 库存数量,\n  s.lot_no AS 批次\nFROM t_wms_stock s\nLEFT JOIN t_bd_part p ON s.part_no = p.part_no\nLEFT JOIN t_wms_warehouse wh ON s.warehouse_id = wh.id\nWHERE p.part_no = ''P001'' OR p.part_name ILIKE ''%P001%''\nORDER BY wh.warehouse_name\nLIMIT 500;"}');
