-0.00710661,0.035462435,-0.005536993,-0.016986532,-0.027270894,-0.03921154,0.023123767,0.05407957,-0.024471905,-0.02135193,-0.0074596936,-0.014816673,0.02953063,0.01833467,-0.018219115,-0.062194075,-0.045117665,-0.0056846463,-0.03474343,-0.018360348,-0.05256452,-0.048584305,-0.01377668,0.033998743,0.043012004,-0.0340501,-0.057263743,-0.011118924,0.0288373,0.03620712,0.021865506,0.0525902,-0.05233341,-0.03338245,-0.005370081,0.008717955,0.053103775,0.0125569375,0.0081337625,0.022070935,0.02994149,0.018796887,0.0288373,-0.022918336,-0.00048669367,0.0089041265,-0.042344354,-0.008024627,-0.03312566,-0.029017054,-0.016909495,0.009873502,-0.02070996,-0.034152813,0.026179545,-0.020324776,0.012954959,-0.03289455,-0.04141992,-0.043345828,-0.031559255,-0.043474223,0.035616506,-0.040110298,0.032791838,-0.0071001905,5.5971777e-05,-0.04026437,-0.028708907]', '场景：工单领料与BOM对比
用户问题：工单 WO20240001 的实际领料与BOM计划用料对比
SQL：
SELECT 
  b.item_part_id,
  bp.part_no AS 子件料号,
  bp.part_name AS 子件名称,
  b.item_qty * wo.plan_qty AS BOM计划用量,
  COALESCE(SUM(md.actual_qty), 0) AS 实际领料量,
  (COALESCE(SUM(md.actual_qty), 0) - b.item_qty * wo.plan_qty) AS 差异
FROM t_pd_wo wo
LEFT JOIN t_pd_wo_bom wb ON wo.wo_no = wb.wo_no
LEFT JOIN t_bd_bom b ON wb.bom_id = b.id
LEFT JOIN t_bd_bom_detail bd ON b.id = bd.bom_id
LEFT JOIN t_bd_part bp ON bd.item_part_id = bp.id
LEFT JOIN t_wms_wo', '{"question": "工单 WO20240001 的实际领料与BOM计划用料对比", "scenario": "工单领料与BOM对比", "full_text": "场景：工单领料与BOM对比\n用户问题：工单 WO20240001 的实际领料与BOM计划用料对比\nSQL：\nSELECT \n  b.item_part_id,\n  bp.part_no AS 子件料号,\n  bp.part_name AS 子件名称,\n  b.item_qty * wo.plan_qty AS BOM计划用量,\n  COALESCE(SUM(md.actual_qty), 0) AS 实际领料量,\n  (COALESCE(SUM(md.actual_qty), 0) - b.item_qty * wo.plan_qty) AS 差异\nFROM t_pd_wo wo\nLEFT JOIN t_pd_wo_bom wb ON wo.wo_no = wb.wo_no\nLEFT JOIN t_bd_bom b ON wb.bom_id = b.id\nLEFT JOIN t_bd_bom_detail bd ON b.id = bd.bom_id\nLEFT JOIN t_bd_part bp ON bd.item_part_id = bp.id\nLEFT JOIN t_wms_wo_material_bill mb ON wo.wo_no = mb.wo_no\nLEFT JOIN t_wms_wo_material_bill_detail md ON mb.id = md.doc_id AND md.part_id = bd.item_part_id\nWHERE wo.wo_no = ''WO20240001''\nGROUP BY b.item_part_id, bp.part_no, bp.part_name, b.item_qty, wo.plan_qty\nLIMIT 500;"}');
