用户问题：上月各设备的报修次数和平均维修时长
SQL：
SELECT 
  e.equipment_code AS 设备编号,
  e.equipment_name AS 设备名称,
  COUNT(r.id) AS 报修次数,
  ROUND(AVG(EXTRACT(EPOCH FROM (r.repair_end_time - r.create_time))/3600), 2) AS 平均维修时长_小时
FROM t_ems_repair_request r
LEFT JOIN t_ems_equipment e ON r.equipment_code = e.equipment_code
WHERE r.create_time >= DATE_TRUNC(''month'', CURRENT_DATE - INTERVAL ''1 month'')
  AND r.create_time < DATE_TRUNC(''month'', CURRENT_DATE)
GROUP BY e.equipment_code, e.equipment_name
ORDER BY 报修', '{"question": "上月各设备的报修次数和平均维修时长", "scenario": "设备维修统计", "full_text": "场景：设备维修统计\n用户问题：上月各设备的报修次数和平均维修时长\nSQL：\nSELECT \n  e.equipment_code AS 设备编号,\n  e.equipment_name AS 设备名称,\n  COUNT(r.id) AS 报修次数,\n  ROUND(AVG(EXTRACT(EPOCH FROM (r.repair_end_time - r.create_time))/3600), 2) AS 平均维修时长_小时\nFROM t_ems_repair_request r\nLEFT JOIN t_ems_equipment e ON r.equipment_code = e.equipment_code\nWHERE r.create_time >= DATE_TRUNC(''month'', CURRENT_DATE - INTERVAL ''1 month'')\n  AND r.create_time < DATE_TRUNC(''month'', CURRENT_DATE)\nGROUP BY e.equipment_code, e.equipment_name\nORDER BY 报修次数 DESC\nLIMIT 500;"}');

